 # OSP Facility Engineer / Fiber Engineer

## LHTC Broadband

Donegal, PA  |  Full-time

### Apply Now

---

### Full Job Description

LHTC Broadband is a rural telecommunications and internet service provider that specializes in broadband internet, television, VoIP, and Ethernet services for Western Pennsylvania. Currently our service area covers parts of Westmoreland, Somerset, and Fayette Counties in PA.

The OSP Facility Engineer / Fiber Engineer will provide engineering support for OSP design and operation, with the role including the following duties:

- Maintain outside plant facility records and provide OSP design
- Site visits to verify field conditions and assist with fiber optic cable placement and splicing activities
- Research and arrange ROW, easements, and permits for new construction
- Attend and participate in planning meetings
- Supervise construction contractors
- Work with municipalities on permitting and franchise agreements
- Work with state and county agencies on road permits
- Develop fiber network design documents and construction drawings using AutoCAD
- Develop fiber network design documents and construction drawings using ESRI ArcGIS (CAD/GIS)

**Qualifications:**
- Associates or bachelors degree in related engineering field preferred
- OSP/Fiber design experience preferred
- AutoCAD experience required
- ArcGIS experience required
- Ability to read and understand utility engineering drawings
- Own transportation required

$65,000–$85,000

---

